{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>And I will cover.</b> With shin or with samekh the meaning is the same. And the commentators said that <b>My hand.</b> is like עב, as in 'upon palms he covered light' (Job 36:32), 'behold, upon palms I engraved you' (Isaiah 49:16), but it is not only its plain sense."], :book :exodus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 33, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Piotrkow, 1907-1911" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH990020973480205171/NLI"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:40:06.099436748Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}